<description>&lt;p&gt;Syria is deploying troops and military advisers to Saudi Arabia to help counter Houthi attacks under a new defence cooperation deal that includes $403 million in loans. Syrian forces have also been involved in a landmine explosion in Deir ez-Zor that killed one soldier and wounded another, and they foiled a Hezbollah plot targeting the Homs refinery. The government seized more than 280 kg of narcotics smuggled from Lebanon and condemned a terrorist attack on security personnel in Amman. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/6/turkiyes-parliament-ratifies-mecca-defence-agreement&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNRGZLWkpsUHNLdGJzM3NTWkpsQ25NUFlWQzdZcEEwZjNFdlN1WUVnU3o3ME16S0NCX0N5MXpELWd3ZklKN0dhRHpLMmtkV0d2bDFIQ0Y0YlA5QkkwQ2QxUUpuVU43MkhJVUZGT294QUNZeGxqNUtBN2dKeEQ2a0twWGNpU1FUZGJSYlpPQW1PTlZjcVlzeEtvT2lFd3hvcnJtbXY0bFlxdzFXaUZuNXlDQkFR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ahram Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQdDZYaE5oMzlmNzktTFJyTmNEUkE3UmFtQURzaUNBSkhxclpCY0R3bmdQa2cxLU9jbW0wWkY4bVp6eDV1RE9sUmNTVURyWnEzYTFFcmtvWExEY0FLazdLeklIM2QyUVFFUjlBVC1lV1VoS2Z0Ql9Ca1Uxem9jMXkyc096Y0VuaVEzN1NKLUlYeVh1azFQMFBqZWt0Nk5CYl9mVXFGVWxBWjdkdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Şafak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPdUVrV3QtVkNFV3FTWGpETU0yNHNOdldnak9WZHNMdXhlRU9iME9xRTQ2YndIbHhOVHRoZC1YdEJZR2g2amNoOXRRRUk4SXZ2bkFwVFJPYXBWUUZJalBHb2xxb213SlpUUjAwVmI4ZDVzOVNiT3hOY002MUxLS0o2Q1FYdWRWcTUxZ0xJNlY0WFlCZjZOWTFSaDFGNWpSWVNYdWc4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kurdistan24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNSy0ybXRXSnRNQkljUU1oUXluN0V5aWlFdm96aVBKTEFhbThYcDVXbjd4MVJEaHNLZFlJ